    "title": "Jump Game VI",
    "category": "Greedy",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an integer array and an integer K, start at index 0 and reach the last index. From position i, you may jump to any index in the range [i+1, i+K]. Each visited element contributes to the score. Determine the maximum obtainable score.",
